	(text "M.2 M-key slots, one PCIe Gen3 lane each.\nJ1 NVMe SSD: RK3588 controller pcie3x4, PCIe3 PHY lane 0.\nJ2 NPU / FPGA card: RK3588 controller pcie3x2, PCIe3 PHY lane 1.\n100 MHz reference clocks come from the PCIe clock buffer (sheet not drawn yet).\nPCIE_WAKE_L is shared by all PCIe slots (open drain, one pull-up here)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
